Indeo Video 5 decoder
---------------------
core/src/iv50.rs and everything under core/src/iv50/ are derived from FFmpeg's
Indeo Video Interactive 5 decoder (libavcodec/indeo5.c, indeo5data.h, ivi.c,
ivi.h, ivi_dsp.c, ivi_dsp.h): its codebooks, run-value maps, scan orders and
dequantisation tables, and the structure of its inverse transforms. Not so
`Picture::rgb` and `bt601` in core/src/iv50.rs: they turn a decoded picture
into RGB in the integer form of BT.601 that Microsoft documents, and are this
project's own, as the rest of it is.

